  "usage": {
    "summary": "`good-chart-scatter` configures one series inside `good-scatter-chart`; it does not render on its own. Set `source` to a `GoodChartDataSource.id` and set both `xKey` and `yKey` to declared keys. X must be numeric for a numeric axis or date/datetime for a time axis. Y must be numeric. `label` controls the legend and data-table series name. `color` overrides the chart's marker palette for this series.",
